## 416 | GÂP GEH NGIH TÂM ƀON BRAH NDU |  | B♭ major | 4/4 |  | 432:full page;433:upper section, song 417 below |
V:
Gâp geh ngih tâm ƀon Brah Ndu chrat ang lơn ma nar. Gâp geh ngih tâm ƀon Brah Ndu chrat ang lơn ma nar. Gâp geh ngih tâm ƀon Brah Ndu chrat ang lơn ma nar, ngai, ntŭk ngai lơn tâm trôk.
V:
Gâp dơn jêh Yê-su tâm rklaih, ăn May ƀư tâm ban. Gâp dơn jêh Yê-su tâm rklaih, ăn May ƀư tâm ban. Gâp dơn jêh Yê-su tâm rklaih, ăn May ƀư tâm ban. Ri jêng nau Păng kuăl may.
C:
Kôrah Brah ơi, Kôranh Brah, dăn may kah gĭt ma gâp. Kôranh Brah ơi, Kôranh Brah, dăn may kah gĭt ma gâp. Kôranh Brah ơi, Kôranh Brah, dăn may kah gĭt ma gâp, ngai, ntŭk ngai lơn tâm trôk.
X: 433:0,0,1142,1000
N: No reference, credits or chords printed. Same song as 302 in a different layout. Refrain prints 'Kôrah' (typo); kept as printed.

